{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/344380-help-creating-a-villian-ctd-mta","id":344380,"title":"help creating a villian (CtD\\MtA)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-18T22:29:13-08:00","id":344380,"title":"help creating a villian (CtD\\MtA)","content":"Im running a MtA game and for a while i been interested un using a Nightmare as a villian. Something like Sandman's The Corinthian , the catch is, i never read Changeling. So, could a ST of CtD help me out to create a sociopathic nightmare that makes/influences humans do horrible acts? I mean stats and such, P.S i never read anything of CtD, i hace no knowledge of the game por its mechanics, im curios about it but i been told its quite hard to ST <br /> <br /> P.s 2 im writting this from a tablet, sorry forma thy typos","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-19T07:25:11-08:00","id":344689,"title":"","content":"I say this as someone who adores CtD and thinks it's by far the easiest of the cWoD games to ST - use Mage rules to make your antagonist. It is the game you're most familiar with and the rule set you know the best. That will make a huge difference at the gaming table.<br /> <br />